    LLM: 'Track which board cards opponents have; they may need one of yours at showdown.\n\nBet in the third round to force folds and remove a card another player might need for their hand.\n\nIf you can see a player has a strong hand (e.g. straight flush visible), bet to make others fold so their key board card is mucked and that hand is no longer possible.',
    Player: 'Track which board cards opponents have; they may need one of yours at showdown.\n\nBet in the third round to force folds and remove a card another player might need for their hand.\n\nIf you can see a player has a strong hand (e.g. straight flush visible), bet to make others fold so their key board card is mucked and that hand is no longer possible.',
